// Title: PowerShell Web Access Installation - PsScript
// ID: 5f9c7f1a-7c21-4c39-b2f3-8d8006e0e51f
// Status: test
// Level: high
// Author: Michael Haag
// Date: 2024-09-03
// Tags: attack.persistence, attack.execution, attack.t1059.001
// Description: Detects the installation and configuration of PowerShell Web Access, which could be used for remote access and potential abuse
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

_sourceCategory=* | where (((ScriptBlockText matches "*Add-PswaAuthorizationRule*" and ScriptBlockText matches "*-UserName **" and ScriptBlockText matches "*-ComputerName **")) or (ScriptBlockText matches "*Install-PswaWebApplication*") or (ScriptBlockText matches "*Install-WindowsFeature WindowsPowerShellWebAccess*"))
